  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 RNA encoders achieve high performance (0.6530 accuracy) in multiprofile settings. This experiment tests scgpt RNA encoder in multiprofile settings with avgpool aggregation, directly comparing it to scvi_n200. It isolates the RNA encoder's impact while maintaining the effective multiprofile setting, addressing uncertainty about whether scgpt could outperform scvi_n200. This balances exploration of new encoders with exploitation of proven multiprofile benefits."
